Subject: [PATCH 15/24] =?UTF-8?q?feat(doze):=20Phase=202A=20=E5=BC=80?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=90=AF=20Doze/AOD=20=E8=83=BD=E5=8A=9B=EF=BC=88batch26?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EF=BC=89?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- config_dozeComponent 指向 SystemUI DozeService（原来为空，能力未暴露）
- config_dozeAlwaysOnDisplayAvailable=true / dozeAfterScreenOffByDefault=true
- config_dozeAlwaysOnEnabled=false：默认不自动开 AOD，用户手动开启
---
 overlay/frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config.xml | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/overlay/frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config.xml b/overlay/frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config.xml
index 72d7e66..3356fd6 100644
--- a/overlay/frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config.xml
+++ b/overlay/frameworks/base/core/res/res/values/config.xml
@@ -16,4 +16,14 @@
     <bool name="config_setColorTransformAccelerated">true</bool>
     <bool name="config_nightDisplayAvailable">true</bool>
     <bool name="config_reduceBrightColorsAvailable">true</bool>
+
+    <!--
+      Phase 2A：Doze / AOD。
+      - DozeService 存在，但 AOSP 默认 config_dozeComponent 为空，能力从未暴露
+      - 默认不自动开 AOD（config_dozeAlwaysOnEnabled=false），用户可在设置里手动开
+    -->
+    <string name="config_dozeComponent" translatable="false">com.android.systemui/com.android.systemui.doze.DozeService</string>
+    <bool name="config_dozeAlwaysOnDisplayAvailable">true</bool>
+    <bool name="config_dozeAfterScreenOffByDefault">true</bool>
+    <bool name="config_dozeAlwaysOnEnabled">false</bool>
 </resources>
